<title>USA: Fed says coupon pass totaled $1.423 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says coupon pass totaled $1.423 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $1.423 billion in permanent reserves to the banking system in its coupon pass operation on Wednesday, the Federal Reserve Bank of New York confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
